{"ref":"BDB, מֵידְבָא","hw":"מֵידְבָא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מֵידְבָא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> city in Moab <strong>(</strong>MI 8 <span dir=\"rtl\">מהדבה</span><strong>)</strong>—<a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:30\" href=\"/Numbers.21.30\">Nu 21:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.2\">Is 15:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:9\" href=\"/Joshua.13.9\">Jos 13:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:16\" href=\"/Joshua.13.16\">16</a> assigned to Reuben (𝔊 Δαιδαβαν, Μαιδαβα, 𝔊L Μεδαβα); <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.7\">1 Ch 19:7</a> meeting-place of Ammonites (𝔊 Μαιθαβα, A 𝔊L Μηδαβα).","next":"BDB, מֵידָד²","prev":"BDB, מִישָׁאֵל"}